# Enforce LF line endings for all text files.
#
# Why this matters here: the round-trip invariant (docs/planner-handoff.md)
# requires deterministic LF output from every serializer. Without this file,
# Git's core.autocrlf=true rewrites the committed JSON fixtures to CRLF on a
# Windows checkout, so the FHIR byte-stability tests (idempotence,
# unknown-field preservation, provenance round-trip) compare the serializer's
# LF output against CRLF fixtures and fail — even though CI on Linux stays
# green. Pinning eol=lf keeps every checkout byte-identical to what CI sees.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize or diff as text.
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
